Many nethackers record the levels where they find important
things (alters, shops, etc.).  Maybe it would be good if the
game did this for us.  It could do this whenever you enter
any important room.

For example, You press "\", it lists your discoveries, and then
lists:

Level 1: Fountain
Level 2: Shop
Level 3: Shop, Altar, 2 Fountains
Level 4:
Level 5: Throne Room, Altar
etc.

Maybe it could also, in a similar manner, keep track of genocides and 
wishes.

Maybe it could also allow you to edit the Level list, so you could
record places where you stashed things.  eg:

Level 1: Fountain
Level 2: Shop
Level 3: Shop, Altar, Fountain
Level 4:                        | A live nymph with my Excalibur
Level 5: Throne Room, Altar     | 4000 $
etc.

Comments?

If I were to code this, would anyone want it?
